// Calculate a ceiling to expand the chart area a bit. Use this as max value in chart settings. Finds the max value grouped by a specific column, then multiplies that max value by a chosen amount over 1 (in this case 1% higher)

CF_sum_expenditures_ceiling = 
VAR _max =
    MAXX (
        ALL ( 'expenditures'[FSC_YR] ),
        [M_sum_expenditures]
    )
RETURN
    _max * 1.01